# The build context is this repository, and the image needs nearly all of it.
# Only exclude what would bloat the context or leak into the wheel.
#
# This file used to be an "exclude everything, then re-include four directories"
# affair, because the build context was the workspace ABOVE this repo, which also
# held the engine, a Unity project and two full pcsx-redux checkouts. Gigabytes
# went to the daemon on every build. The repo is self-contained now, so the context
# is small by construction and this can say what it means.

.git
.gitignore
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
build/
dist/
.venv/

# The sample plug-in is documentation, not something the image runs.
examples/
